                        "sense_id": "f50fa47e-48f6-32e5-b684-49b6fdda782f",
                        "entry_id": "657203f6-d2af-36f2-ae30-28a5c2cacfc7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A person with only one testicle."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9cd3005d-4866-4f1b-be37-591edff62670",
                                "sense_id": "f50fa47e-48f6-32e5-b684-49b6fdda782f",
                                "text": "A preparation from a monorchis, or the testis (from a boy of ten years of age), not yet descended from the cavity of the abdomen into the scrotum."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "009299bc-87f2-4b63-9c1b-c18398a489b4",
                                "sense_id": "f50fa47e-48f6-32e5-b684-49b6fdda782f",
                                "text": "Palletta examined the body of a man aged about fifty, who was supposed to be a monorchis. The spermatic vessels on the left side, as they approached the pelvis, gradually disappeared, a white transparent process alone remaining […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cf0fdaf1-2551-4ba9-bbd9-ca7ee4a2f186",
                                "sense_id": "f50fa47e-48f6-32e5-b684-49b6fdda782f",
                                "text": "Monorchides, as they are called, have been known to be prolific."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e438a194-c774-467f-a555-b7acc5d67045",
                                "sense_id": "f50fa47e-48f6-32e5-b684-49b6fdda782f",
                                "text": "Monorchides, or persons possessing only one testicle, are now excluded even from the doubtful causes of impotence […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ea9b84fb-a822-4727-942f-1909577a121e",
                                "sense_id": "f50fa47e-48f6-32e5-b684-49b6fdda782f",
                                "text": "I myself knew a civil official in Europe, a monorchis with large penis, who was very vigorous in sexualibus until advanced age, and late in life begat two boys, the younger of whom is also a monorchis. […] In many places the popular belief accredits such monorchids with possessing extraordinary power."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c670d48d-9e5e-45aa-a112-338e619277c3",
                                "sense_id": "f50fa47e-48f6-32e5-b684-49b6fdda782f",
                                "text": "The same practices are recorded in the case of Tamerlane, the Asiatic conqueror, who was also a monorchis."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
